{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the TRMNL Private Plugin "Markup" editor for the broforce
  plugin (Polling strategy, refresh_interval: 5 - the fetch itself is
  throttled to once/day server-side, see fetch.mjs). Field names match the
  JSON produced by fetch.mjs.

  "image-dither" is added here (unlike banksy) because these portraits are
  kept in full colour by generate-portraits.mjs - TRMNL's own dithering is
  what turns them into a fine-grained e-ink-friendly image at render time.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--small">
  <img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ bro.image_url }}" style="max-height: 70%;">
  <div class="label label--large">{{ bro.name }}</div>
  <div class="description">{{ bro.description }}</div>
</div>

<div class="title_bar">
  <span class="title">BROFORCE</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
